<title>TURKEY: Turkish consumer prices up 3.4 percent in Dec.</title>
<headline>Turkish consumer prices up 3.4 percent in Dec.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-01-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish consumer prices rose 3.4 percent in December against a 5.2 percent rise in November, the State Institute of Statistics said on Saturday.</p>
<p>It said wholesale prices rose 3.9 percent in December, after rising 5.1 percent a month earlier.</p>
<p>The year-on-year consumer price rise was 79.8 percent in December, compared to 80.4 percent a month ago.</p>
<p>Year-on-year wholesale prices rose 84.9 percent in December, compared with 85.7 percent in November, it said.  </p>
<p> TURKISH PRICES		  Dec 96  Nov 96		 Dec95</p>
<p>Consumer mo/mo pct change     3.4	5.2		    3.8</p>
